# Store text files with LF and check them out with LF on every platform, regardless of
# each machine's core.autocrlf setting. Windows batch files are checked out with CRLF,
# which cmd.exe needs in order to parse labels reliably.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.jar binary
